      203.09,
      397.2,
      239.03
    ],
    "text": "(b)to provide assistance to low income families in urbanand rural communities to meet thir basic needs anduplift living standards;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
