  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      252.29,
      397.24,
      300.59
    ],
    "text": "(c)to use creative arts as a platform, to help childrenand youth of all walks of life, and different culturaland religious backgrounds, to meet and interactwith each to foster unity;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
