      363.05,
      397.2,
      411.23
    ],
    "text": "(e)to provide opportunities for youth to learn new skillsand receive on the job training and assist them toset up small scale businesse within theircommunities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      424.49,
      397.18,
      485.03
    ],
    "text": "(f)to provide an opportunity for people to becomeaware of needs within their communities, andpromote a culture of helping each other and sharingresources or development and growth of their owncommunities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      498.29,
      397.19,
      558.83
    ],
    "text": "(g)to organize free health camps, clinics, check-ups,and other community service camps and distributefree medicines to the needy, with the help ofvolunteer medical professionals, to improve thehealth and well being of citizens;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      572.09,
      397.18,
      620.39
    ],
    "text": "(h)to provide accounting, financial, legal and otherprofessional support and advise to any communityin Sri Lanka, to help them manage their lives in abetter way;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      633.65,
      397.17,
      669.59
    ],
