    ],
    "text": "(m)to promote, arrange and organize exhibitions,lectures, seminars, discussions, workshops and otheractivities with a view to accomplishing theobjectives of the Warehouse Project and to print,publish and distribute such brochures, journals,bulletins and newspapers; and",
    "fonts": [
