      249.53,
      397.2,
      319.43
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of Directors of the Corporation shallconsist of the members of the Board of the Associationholding office on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act. Such Board shall hold officeuntil a Board of Directors is elected in accordance with therules of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      331.49,
      397.25,
      413.03
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from timeto time, at any general meeting and by a majority of votesof not less than two-thirds of the members present to makerules not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act, or anyother written law, for all or any of the following matters andany other matter in relation to the management of the affairsof the Corporation and accomplishment of its objects:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      425.09,
      397.17,
      459.83
    ],
    "text": "(a)the classification of members and mebership fees,their admission, withdrawal, or expulsion frommembership;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
