      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      238.97,
      402.86,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "7.(1) The Corporation shall have its own fund and allmoneys heretofore or hereafter to be received by way ofgifts, bequests, donations, subscription, testamentarydispositions, fees, grants for donations or contributions incash or kind from local or foreign institutes and individuals,members and non-members.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      322.97,
      402.95,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) All monies received shall be deposited in the nameof the Corporation in one or more banks and be invested inany suitable manner as the Board shall determine.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      370.97,
      402.88,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "(3) All expenditure incurred by the Corporation in theexercise, perfomances and discharge of its powers, dutiesand functions of the Corporation shall be paid out of theFunds of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      430.97,
      402.86,
      502.31
    ],
    "text": "8.All debts and liabilities of the Association existingon the day preceding the date of Commencement of thisAct, shall be paid by the Corporation hereby constitutedand all debts due, subscriptions and contributions payableto the Association on that day shall be paid to the Corporationfor the purpose of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      514.97,
      402.86,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "9.No member of the Corporation shall for the purposeof discharging the debts and liabilities of the Corporation orfor any other purpose be liable to make any contributionexceeding the amount due from such member as membershipfees.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
